+# Pagemark - Road to Google Play
+
+Branch: `Pagemark-Google_play` (flavor `play`). The GitHub APK line stays on `Pagemark-APK` / `main`.
+This sits on top of [ROADMAP.md](ROADMAP.md) (feature specs, IDs like `0.5.0-A`) and [PLAY_STORE.md](PLAY_STORE.md) (listing copy, Data safety, build command). It decides **what must ship before publishing** and in what order.
+
+Tags: **MUST** = blocks publishing. **SHOULD** = ship before launch unless you consciously cut it. **LATER** = after launch.
+Size: S (hours) / M (a day or two) / L (several days) / XL (risky, device testing).
+
+## The long pole: the 14-day closed test
+A new personal Play account needs a closed test with 12+ opted-in testers for 14 continuous days before it can request production (verify current rule in Play Console). Start the clock as early as Phase 1 passes, and keep building during the 14 days. Everything below is ordered around that.
+
+---
+
+## Phase 0 - Play plumbing (this branch)
+| | Item | Size | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| MUST | `play` flavor: no updater, no `REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES` | S | done, **uncompiled** |
+| MUST | Privacy policy `docs/PRIVACY.md` (public URL) | S | done |
+| MUST | Verify `flutter build appbundle --flavor play` + CI green; merged manifest has no install permission | S | you (PC) |
+| MUST | Play-flavor privacy text: no GitHub update check in this build (manuals, in-app About) | S | todo |
+| MUST | Play developer account ($25), identity verification, app created in Console | S | you |
+| MUST | Upload key + Play App Signing; add Play signing SHA-1 as Android OAuth client (Drive backup) | S | you |
+| MUST | `targetSdk` meets Play's current minimum (check Flutter 3.47 default) | S | verify |
+| MUST | Native libs 16 KB page-size aligned (sqlite3, mobile_scanner, cryptography_flutter) - needed for Android 15+ targets | M | verify |
+| MUST | Store assets: 512 icon, 1024x500 feature graphic, 4-8 **light-theme** phone screenshots | M | todo |
+| MUST | Data safety form, content rating, target audience (13+), ads=no, app access=none | S | cheat-sheet in PLAY_STORE.md |
+| SHOULD | `<uses-feature android:name="android.hardware.camera" android:required="false"/>` so camera-less devices can install | S | todo |
+| SHOULD | Versioning rule: `+N` strictly increasing, one counter shared by both flavors' tags | S | todo |
+
+## Phase 1 - v0.4.2 "Close the gaps" (ROADMAP section 1) - then start closed test
+| | Item | Size |
+|---|---|---|
+| MUST | **0.4.2-B strip unused permissions** (READ_MEDIA_*, READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE, FOREGROUND_SERVICE_* you don't use). Leftover media/foreground-service permissions trigger Play declaration forms | S |
+| MUST | 0.4.2-A Vault Trash (locked books can't be restored today) | M |
+| SHOULD | 0.4.2-C PIN note after restore | S |
+| SHOULD | 0.4.2-D Search noise ranking (first impression for new users) | M |
+| LATER | 0.4.2-E debug updater preview (APK flavor only) | S |
+| n/a | 0.4.2-F release workflow: APK line only; add a second job for the AAB (needs upload-key secrets) | M |
+| SHOULD | **New:** "Delete all data" in Settings (wipes DB, covers, prefs, secure storage); supports the Data safety deletion answer | M |
+| SHOULD | **New:** "Copy diagnostic log" + support link (no telemetry, so this is the only bug-report path) | S |
+
+**Gate A - open closed test** (internal test first, then closed with 12+ testers on 0.4.2 AAB). Real-phone pass: scan, biometrics, Drive backup/restore from a Play-installed build, export, restore on a second device.
+
+## Phase 2 - v0.5.0 "Bring your books, see your books" (during the test)
+| | Item | Size |
+|---|---|---|
+| SHOULD | 0.5.0-A Pagemark CSV/JSON import | L |
+| SHOULD | 0.5.0-B Goodreads CSV import (biggest acquisition feature) | L |
+| LATER | 0.5.0-C StoryGraph CSV | M |
+| SHOULD | 0.5.0-D grid / cover-wall view | M |
+| SHOULD | 0.5.0-E multi-select, bulk actions, swipe, undo | L |
+
+## Phase 3 - v0.6.0 "Capture more"
+| | Item | Size |
+|---|---|---|
+| SHOULD | 0.6.0-A quotes & highlights (schema 4, export v2) | L |
+| SHOULD | 0.6.0-B local covers + zip backup container (offline library, backups include covers) | XL |
+| LATER | 0.6.0-C heat/content notes (adult-flavored; default off, never exported unless enabled) | M |
+| LATER | 0.6.0-D author pages, series totals | M |
+| LATER | 0.6.0-E sub-ratings | M |
+
+## Phase 4 - v0.7.0 "Security depth" (before public launch)
+| | Item | Size |
+|---|---|---|
+| SHOULD | 0.7.0-A SQLCipher encrypted DB + migration. High risk; the privacy-first pitch is stronger with it. Ship only after emulator + real-phone migration tests | XL |
+| SHOULD | 0.7.0-B auto-lock timeout, whole-app lock | M |
+| SHOULD | 0.7.0-C backup-failure notification (adds POST_NOTIFICATIONS; permission prompt + Data safety unaffected) | M |
+| SHOULD | 0.7.0-D R8/shrink + keep rules; upload `mapping.txt` to Play. Device-test every plugin path | L |
+| done | 0.7.0-E privacy/Play docs (this branch) | - |
+
+## Phase 5 - Quality bar for a public listing (from ROADMAP 0.9.0, pulled forward)
+| | Item | Size |
+|---|---|---|
+| SHOULD | Accessibility pass: TalkBack labels, 48 dp targets, 200% text, no overflow | L |
+| SHOULD | Tablet/landscape two-pane at >= 840 dp (Play large-screen quality) | L |
+| SHOULD | Edge-to-edge + predictive back on Android 15/16 | M |
+| LATER | Localization (ARB; en first), RTL check | L |
+| LATER | iOS (needs a Mac) - separate track, not a Play gate | XL |
+
+## Gate B - production request
+- [ ] Closed test ran 14 continuous days with 12+ testers; crashes/ANRs in Play vitals reviewed
+- [ ] All MUST rows done; all SHOULD rows done or consciously cut (write the cut list in the changelog)
+- [ ] No open data-loss/leak issue; `flutter analyze` clean, `flutter test` green
+- [ ] Release AAB signed with upload key; mapping uploaded; versionCode higher than the test builds
+- [ ] Store listing, graphics, privacy URL, Data safety, content rating all submitted and "Ready to publish"
+- [ ] Manuals regenerated for the Play flavor (no sideload/updater text), light-theme screenshots
+
+Production launch version: **1.0.0** (Play), tagged on this branch.
+
+## Post-launch (1.1+)
+Reminders, home-screen widget, share target, app shortcuts (ROADMAP section 5); StoryGraph import; localization; parking-lot items; iOS.
+
+## Decisions for you
+1. **Cut line:** is Phase 3 (quotes, local covers) in launch, or ship after Phase 2 + 4?
+2. **SQLCipher before launch?** Safer pitch vs. highest-risk change in the whole plan.
+3. **Two lines long-term:** keep `Pagemark-APK` alive (updater) or move everyone to Play after launch? Existing APK users can't upgrade in place (different signing key).
